{"id":"n15870-1-7","stage":3,"title":"발자국 · 脚印","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15870-1-7-1","ko":"여기 엄청 큰 발자국들이 있어.","zh":"这里有非常大的脚印。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발자국들이","meaning":"脚印","explanation":"발자국：脚印；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발자국","audio":"/audio/9ffceb44a012c6dc0cdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15870","senseId":"1","lemma":"발자국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"9ffceb44a012c6dc","term":"발자국","zh":"脚印","a